% Scenario: crop box and rotation. The document default crop box
% applies to every page that sets none; page 1 adds a rotation, page 2
% sets its own crop box and keeps the default rotation, none.
[ /CropBox [36 36 576 756] /PAGES pdfmark
[ /Rotate 90 /PAGE pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
[ /CropBox [0 0 288 288] /PAGE pdfmark
72 72 moveto 200 72 lineto stroke
showpage
